2484 0L98 0L98 43Z&#x27;/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;);-webkit-mask-position:left top;-webkit-mask-repeat:repeat-x;-webkit-mask-size:98px 43px"></div></div></div><div class="tie-bg-primary fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 flex items-center gap-4 px-4 py-4 transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out lg:hidden pointer-events-none -translate-y-full opacity-0" data-testid="location-details-mobile-sticky-header" data-visible="false"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-2"><a class="tie-type-button inline-flex min-h-12 max-w-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 text-center whitespace-normal tie-bg-accent tie-text-on-accent transition-opacity duration-200 ease-in-out hover:opacity-70 focus-visible:tie-focus-ring w-full md:w-auto" href="https://cafebarolo.nl/" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center" style="height:16px;width:16px"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="block h-full w-full" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M22.6488 52.9415H48.4634L5 9.21463L9.21464 5L52.9415 48.4634V22.6488H59V55.839H55.839V59H22.6488V52.9415Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span><span class="min-w-0 break-words">Bezoek de website</span></a></div><span class="tie-color-accent font-tie-bold hidden max-w-[42%] text-right text-[24px] leading-[26px] tracking-[-0.8px] md:block">Café Barolo</span></div><div class="order-4 px-6 pt-8 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2 lg:ml-[calc(100vw/12)] lg:w-[50vw] lg:px-4 lg:pt-20 2xl:ml-[276.667px] 2xl:w-[533.333px] 2xl:px-4" data-testid="location-details-body"><div class="text-black" data-testid="location-details-body-copy"><div class="flex flex-col gap-10 text-black"><div class="tie-rich-text [&amp;_h3]:tie-type-highlighted-title [&amp;_h4]:tie-type-highlighted-title"><p>Het café beschikt over een kelder met 300 zorgvuldig geselecteerde parels. Je kunt kiezen uit verschillende tastings: van vier halve glazen met bites tot zes halve glazen met een volledige maaltijd.<br/><br/>De koude gerechten op de kaart bij Café Barolo liegen er niet om. Ga jij voor oesters, pistachemortadella, venkelsalami of kaviaar? Als je daarna nog ruimte over hebt, kun je onder andere kiezen voor een artisjokbloem, een kroket van ossenstaart of Abuela’s gehaktballetjes in tomatensaus. Ben je helemaal fan van een kaasplankje? Dan kun je hier je hart ophalen.<br/></p></div><section><h3 class="tie-type-highlighted-title m-0">Reviews</h3><ul class="mt-4 flex list-none flex-col gap-3 p-0"><li><a class="group tie-type-meta inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-black no-underline" href="https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=eee2bc57351991e6&amp;rlz=1C1GCEA_enNL1122NL1122&amp;tbm=lcl&amp;q=Caf%C3%A9+Barolo+Reviews&amp;rflfq=1&amp;num=20&amp;stick=H4sIAAAAAAAAAONgkxIxNLcwtzC1NLA0MTA3MzUzNDI0N9_AyPiKUcQ5Me3wSgWnxKL8nHyFoNSyzNTy4kWsWIUBghllx0kAAAA&amp;rldimm=17878590940765612177&amp;hl=nl-NL&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwisxvSm4ZuOAxUc87sIHSHTKyMQ9fQKegQISBAF&amp;biw=1745&amp;bih=828&amp;dpr" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-tie-red" style="height:16px;width:16px"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="block h-full w-full" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M22.6488 52.9415H48.4634L5 9.21463L9.21464 5L52.9415 48.4634V22.6488H59V55.839H55.839V59H22.6488V52.9415Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span><span class="lg:group-hover:underline lg:group-hover:underline-offset-2">Bekijk op Google</span></a></li></ul></section><section><h3 class="tie-type-highlighted-title m-0">Openingstijden</h3><dl class="m-0 grid grid-cols-[max-content_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-[18px] leading-6 tracking-[var(--tie-letter-spacing)] text-tie-dark-gray [&amp;_dt]:font-tie-bold mt-4 w-full gap-y-2 text-black! lg:max-w-[300px] [&amp;_dd]:text-black! [&amp;_dt]:text-black!"><div class="contents"><dt class="font-normal">Maandag</dt><dd class="m-0">16:00 – 22: